    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Berkeley & Associates are delighted to present 45 Glenaulin Road to the market, a fantastic double-fronted, three-bedroom semi-detached family home with a stunning west-facing rear garden. No. 45 is ideally positioned along this premier, highly sought-after, quiet and mature road located in Old Palmerstown. This is a spacious, bright, natural light-filled family home that is ready for immediate occupation and comes with no onward chain.\r\n\r\nThe property provides an excellent combination of space, comfort and convenience, making it an ideal home for modern family living. The ground floor comprises a welcoming entrance hall, a comfortable sitting room, a spacious living room, a bright open-plan kitchen, and a further room off the kitchen, ideal for use as a home office or potentially as an additional bedroom.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, the property offers three spacious bedrooms and a family bathroom.\r\nExternally, the property benefits from ample off-street parking and a superb west-facing rear garden with stunning planting, outside toilet plumbed for a washing machine and dryer with a large shed at the end. The garden enjoys excellent sunlight throughout the day and provides an ideal outdoor space for relaxation and entertaining.\r\n\r\nSuperbly positioned in the heart of Palmerstown, this property enjoys an enviable location close to an excellent range of local amenities. St. Lorcan’s and St. Bridget’s National Schools, local churches, shops and recreational facilities are all within easy reach. The property also benefits from excellent transport links, with convenient access to the M50 via Junction 7. Dublin Airport is approximately 20 minutes away, while Dublin city centre is just five miles to the east, making this an ideal location for both city living and convenient commuting.\r\n\r\n45 Glenaulin Road presents an excellent opportunity to acquire a spacious and versatile family home. Contact Berkeley & Associates today, as early viewing is highly recommended to fully appreciate all that this property has to offer."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Accommodation\r\nEntrance Hall – 2.15m x 3.90m\r\nAlarm Panel, Radiator cover and full fitted carpets.\r\n\r\nFamily Room – 3.62m x 3.77m\r\nPendent Light, fully fitted carpets, featured fireplace and surround and large window to the front.\r\n\r\nLiving Room – 5.87m x 3.81m\r\nA fine size room with feature fireplace and surround. Two large windows to the rear and fully fitted carpets with feature storage units.\r\n\r\n\r\nSecond Living Room 2.99m x 4.79m\r\nLarge front window with wooden flooring.\r\n\r\nKitchen – 2.98m x 5,16m\r\nRange of floor and eye level timber units with a timber counter top, featuring oven, hob, extractor fan, fridge/freezer and dishwasher. Fully tiled floor with large window to the rear.\r\n\r\nMaster Bedroom – 3.58m x 3.92m \r\nLarge double bedroom with fully fitted carpets, wardrobes and a large window looking out over the rear garden. \r\n\r\nBedroom 2  - 3.58m x 3.65m \r\nLarge double bedroom with fully fitted carpets, wardrobes and a large window looking out over the front garden. \r\n\r\nBedroom 3 – 2.80m x 2.47m \r\nGood size bedroom with fully fitted carpets and a large window.\r\n\r\nBathroom – 2.19m x 1.72m\r\nSpacious modern bathroom with a large walkin shower, fully tiled throughout, W.C, Wash hand basin and good size window. \r\n\r\nLanding – 2.19m x 3.28m \r\nFitted Carpets.\r\nMeasurements are only given as a guidance."
      },
      {
